How large are the accuracy gaps, and how uncertain are they?
Each row is model A minus model B, on the same 2,198 questions. Dots: the observed gap. Lines: its 95% interval. A line that crosses zero did not
establish a difference; the colour shows a related but separate test, adjusted across these 53 comparisons (15 pass).
